14:["$","p","p-10",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Why It Matters"}],"\nHumans are fundamentally social creatures. Our nervous systems are designed to co-regulate with others. Isolation is one of the strongest risk factors for mental health decline, while strong social connections are the most consistent predictor of resilience."]}]
