26:["$","p","p-20",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Why It Matters"}],"\nBelieving you can handle challenges is a self-fulfilling prophecy. Self-efficacy—the belief in your ability to influence outcomes—is a core resilience factor."]}]
