2e:["$","h3","h3-6",{"children":"Pillar 4: Meaning - Purpose and Values"}]
2f:["$","p","p-25",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Why It Matters"}],"\nViktor Frankl, the psychiatrist who survived the Holocaust, observed that those who found meaning in their suffering were most likely to survive. Purpose provides a \"why\" that makes the \"how\" bearable."]}]
