a1:["$","p","p-74",{"children":"Resilience is not about never falling down—it's about always getting back up. It's not about avoiding pain—it's about moving through it with grace. It's not about going it alone—it's about building the connections and skills that help you weather any storm."}]
a2:["$","p","p-75",{"children":"The research is clear: resilience can be built. Every practice in this guide, no matter how small, contributes to your capacity to handle whatever life brings. The key is consistency—not perfection."}]
a3:["$","p","p-76",{"children":"Start where you are. Pick one pillar that resonates. Choose one practice to begin. Small steps, taken consistently, lead to profound transformation."}]
a4:["$","p","p-77",{"children":"You are more capable than you know. And with intentional effort, you can become even more so."}]
a5:["$","p","p-78",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The truly unbreakable mind isn't one that never bends—it's one that always bounces back."}]}]
a6:["$","p","p-79",{"children":["$","em","em-0",{"children":"If you're struggling and these strategies feel overwhelming, please reach out for professional support. Building resilience often begins with asking for help."}]}]
